> Count the tokens in lib/pricing.ts

Source:     lib/pricing.ts
Model:      Claude Sonnet 4.5
Tokenizer:  Claude BPE (Anthropic)
Tokens:     3,842
Characters: 14,219
Ratio:      ~3.7 chars/token
\end{lstlisting}

\noindent\textbf{Step 2: Estimate the context budget.}
The developer checks how much of the context window the current working set consumes.

\begin{lstlisting}
> Estimate my budget for these files: lib/pricing.ts,
  components/Calculator.tsx, app/page.tsx

Model:    Claude Sonnet 4.5 (200K ctx)
Budget:   18.2K / 200K (9.1%) -- COMFORTABLE

