  Files:          ~12.2K    6.1%
  System prompt:  ~ 2.0K    1.0%
  Instructions:   ~ 0.0K    0.0%
  Conversation:   ~   0K    0.0%
  Output reserve: ~ 4.0K    2.0%
\end{lstlisting}

\noindent\textbf{Step 3: Preview the next turn.}
Before sending a large prompt, the developer can preview how many tokens it would add.

\smallskip
These three steps give the developer a clear picture of resource usage before
committing to an API call. In the VS Code extension, this information is always visible in
the sidebar without typing any commands.


