directly into the editor rather than requiring a separate tool, it scores file relevance
rather than only counting tokens, and it connects counts to dollar costs using current
pricing. Tokalator is open source (MIT license). The VS Code extension is on the Visual
Studio Marketplace, the MCP server is on npm, and the web platform is on Vercel. Source
code: \url{https://github.com/vfaraji89/tokalator}.


